# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit the real .env file (it's already
# in .gitignore).

# --- brainbox (optional -- see src/d3rac_agents/brainbox.py) ---
# Without this set, brainbox still runs: it falls back to a deterministic
# directive equivalent to the theta-threshold logic, so `make dev`/CI/tests
# keep working with zero live-API dependency either way. Set it only when
# you actually want brainbox reasoning about triggered communities via a
# real Claude API call instead of the fallback.
#
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/ -- this is a real, billable
# credential tied to your own Anthropic account. It is not something
# anyone else (including any AI assistant that has worked on this repo)
# can generate or supply on your behalf. Prefer a secrets manager over a
# plain .env file for anything beyond local development; if you want CI
# or a deployed environment to use this, set it there as a secret/env var
# directly rather than committing a filled-in .env.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
